  "content": "<h1>动态光照</h1>\n<p>为 Minecraft 添加动态光照功能。所有发光的物品和实体都会产生跟随它们移动的光源。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ei1akpCL/images/b273dabd35c9d12f56949b707368459aa1dd3a68.png\" alt=\"1\"></p>\n<h2>光照等级</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\">光照等级</th>\n<th style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">亮度</th>\n<th style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">光源</th>\n<th style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">实体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>15</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">最亮</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">萤石、海晶灯、灯笼、杰克南瓜灯、菌光体、信标、所有菌光体（翠绿、珠光、赭黄）</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">烈焰人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>14</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">明亮</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">火把、营火、熔岩桶、末地烛</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">&mdash;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>10</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">中等</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">灵魂火把、灵魂灯笼、灵魂营火、红石火把、发光浆果</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">岩浆怪、发光鱿鱼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>7</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">昏暗</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">烈焰棒、烈焰粉、萤石粉、幽匿荧光囊</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">&mdash;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
